": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ratio-Proportion", "sub": "direct-inverse-variation", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 36, "text": "A person bought two buffaloes for₹11,520. One is sold at a loss of 15% and the other is sold at a gain of 19%. If the selling price of both buffaloes is equal, find the cost price of the first one.", "options": [{"text": "₹6,700", "added": false}, {"text": "₹6,720", "added": false}, {"text": "₹6,710", "added": false}, {"text": "₹6,715", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "profit-loss-percent", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 37, "text": "If the simple interest on a certain sum of money for 20 months at the rate of 19.2% per annum exceeds the simple interest on the same sum for 15 months at the rate of 11.2% p.a. by ₹2,920, then what is the sum (in ₹, to the nearest hundreds)?", "options": [{"text": "16,620", "added": false}, {"text": "12,660", "added": false}, {"text": "16,660", "added": false}, {"text": "16,200", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-formula", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 38, "text": "Find the surface area (in m2) of a cuboid that is 11 m long, 7 m broad and 4 m high.", "options": [{"text": "249", "added": false}, {"text": "289", "added": false}, {"text": "298", "added": false}, {"text": "320", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 39, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "16", "added": false}, {"text": "60", "added": false}, {"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "0.06", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "table", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 40, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "12200.43", "added": false}, {"text": "12219.43", "added": false}, {"text": "18750.23", "added": false}, {"text": "11250.25", "added": false}], "options_sour