"text": "27", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 46, "text": "Taking any three of the line segments out of segments of length 2 cm, 5 cm, 7 cm and 8 cm, the number of triangles that can be formed is:", "options": [{"text": "1", "added": false}, {"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Geometry", "sub": "lines-and-angles", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 47, "text": "The value of 264 ÷ 8 − 1 − 32 × 2 + 80 ÷ 5 × 40 ÷ 20 is:", "options": [{"text": "0", "added": false}, {"text": "1", "added": false}, {"text": "3", "added": false}, {"text": "2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 48, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "3 : 2", "added": false}, {"text": "1 : 2", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 3", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 1", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "table", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 49, "text": "The marked price of an immersion rod in an electronic store is ₹900. The store offers a discount of 12% on its sale. At what price (in ₹) can a customer buy it from the electronic store?", "options": [{"text": "782", "added": false}, {"text": "797", "added": false}, {"text": "787", "added": false}, {"text": "792", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Discount", "sub": "single-discount", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 50, "text": "Sapna is double efficient as compared to Rakesh. If they both work together on a project and complete it in 48 days, then the number of days in which Sapna alone can complete the project is:", "options": [{"text": "68", "added": false}, {"text": "72", "added": false}, {"text": "52", "added": false}, {"text": "69 ½", "added": false}], "opti